<title>USA: Union says Quebecor to close two plants.</title>
<headline>Union says Quebecor to close two plants.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Graphic Communications International Union said on Friday that Quebecor plans to close two of its plants in the greater Boston area by the end of the year.</p>
<p>About 60 workers at Semline Inc at Braintree and 80 employees at Semline Westwood have been told that their jobs will end before the new year, the union said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
